# Everything under sim/ is generated: the raw SolidWorks export, and the model
# tools/prepare_model.py builds from it. The source of truth is robot/, which is
# committed. Regenerate, do not edit, and never commit.
# Leading slash on purpose: a bare pattern matches at every depth and last time
# that silently swallowed 48 files somebody meant to keep.
/sim/

